    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d437">

                <pb facs="0679" n="632" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg632"/>

                <head>437. Telegram 1351 from Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d437-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Geneva</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-01-11">January 11, 1956, 11
                        a.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d437-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d437-1"/>
                <p>1351. From Johnson. Re Deptel 1467.</p>
                <p>Would appreciate prior tomorrow’s meeting text any statement by INS re Liu and
                    substance American Red Cross reply to Madame Li.</p>
                <p>Would also appreciate any info that would assist me in answering probable
                    question as to why nothing happened re Liu’s case between attempted deportation
                    11951 when he presumably able travel and date Wang’s letter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Gowen</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
